 "prompt": "This directory holds roomkit, a Python package for booking rooms: models, two kinds of store, a waitlist and an audit history, importers and exporters (with families of partner feeds and calendar exporters described in docs/), validation rules, services, reports, a command line (roomkit/cli), a request handler (roomkit/api) and config-driven pipelines. README.md documents how it behaves today. CHANGE.md describes a change to implement across the whole package: time zones with fixed UTC offsets. Implement everything CHANGE.md describes; anything it does not change must keep behaving as README.md says. Do not modify CHANGE.md, README.md or anything in docs/ or tests/. The visible tests run with `/usr/bin/python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`; more tests than the visible ones check the full behaviour. Code must run on /usr/bin/python3 (Python 3.9), the interpreter the checks use; standard library only.",
